# Build output for this project.
#
# Duplicated from the repository root deliberately. The root .gitignore covers these today, so this
# file changes nothing right now -- it exists so the project stays correct on its own the day it is
# extracted into a repository of its own, where the root file does not travel with it.
bin/
obj/

# This project's package feed, and it is TRACKED -- do not add *.nupkg above.
#
# Restore is offline: NuGet.config clears nuget.org and resolves this package from the folder below,
# and the three Docker builds copy it into the build context before `dotnet restore`. A clone that
# did not carry it could not restore at all. The negations are stated here rather than left to the
# root so they survive an extraction, and because the deepest .gitignore wins -- a `*.nupkg` rule
# added at any level above cannot silently untrack this feed.
!nuget/
!nuget/**
